# 行尾纪律：迁移文件字节级稳定（sqlx checksum 对行尾敏感）
# 2026-09-16 事故：core.autocrlf=true 下 6 个迁移本地以 CRLF apply，CI 镜像内是 LF，
# checksum 漂移 → 官方镜像对存量库启动报 "migration XX was previously applied but has been modified"。
# 以下规则把 SQL/Dockerfile/sh 锁死 LF，杜绝 Windows checkout 再引入 CRLF。
*.sql text eol=lf
*.Dockerfile text eol=lf
Dockerfile text eol=lf
*.sh text eol=lf
*.toml text eol=lf
*.yml text eol=lf
*.yaml text eol=lf
